its tracking into people and animals and the book says neither. || EQUIPMENT: as per O.C.C. plus one bow and arrows (choice of long bow or modern composite bow, the two the block names; arrows row arrows-standard, count unprinted), Vibro-Blade often built into a spear (choice of vibro-spear, vibro-knife, vibro-sword), hunting knife, two water skins or canteens (stored as two canteens), saddlebag, backpack, bandoleer, utility belt, one large sack, two small. Headband has no catalog row and is not granted (suggested slug headband). No money is printed. || AVAILABLE O.C.C.: the book prints tendencies (most are, favoring, virtually any man at arms), not a closed list, so it is restriction prose and no occ_restrictions. The halving of O.C.C. Related and Secondary selections is restriction prose. || NOT STORED: size 6 to 7 feet at the horse shoulders, about 10 feet head to hoof; weight 800 to 1100 pounds; life span 90 years, some to 130; enemies, allies, habitat. They are in GM Notes."
